event: thinking
data: {"id": "b1dba8d300bb4af5-thinking-layer-120", "run_id": "b1dba8d300bb4af5", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我发现集群中有一个 Pod 处于异常状态：\n- **Pod 名称**: `workload`\n- **命名空间**: `aiops-case-v02`\n- **状态**: `Pending`\n- **就绪状态**: `0/1`\n\n该 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态，通常意味着调度器无法将其调度到任何节点上。我将使用 `pod-pending-unschedulable.md` 运行手册来进行进一步诊断。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789111213587}

