data: {"id": "b1dba8d300bb4af5-final", "run_id": "b1dba8d300bb4af5", "seq": 1655, "ts_ms": 1789111307146, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的 container `app` 声明了 `1Pi` 的内存请求（memory: 1Pi），该数值远超集群所有节点（最大约 31.3 TiB）的总可用内存。由于调度器无法在任何节点上找到满足 `1Pi` 资源请求的节点，且无合适的抢占目标，导致 Pod 持续处于 `Pending` 状态（FailedScheduling）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` | `container.app` 的 `memory.request`: `1Pi`, `cpu.request`: `5m` | 定义异常的资源请求配置，明确调度失败的根本约束。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | Pod `phase`: `Pending`, `PodScheduled` condition: `False` | 确认异常现象，Pod 未被调度到任何节点。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | `reason`: `FailedScheduling`, `message`: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` | 直接证据，证明调度器在所有 3 个节点上均判定内存不足。 |\n| 4 | Topology | `kubernetes` | `pod:aiops-case-v02/workload` owns container `aiops-case-v02/app` | 建立实体层级关系，确认内存配置属于当前异常的容器。 |\n\n证据链逻辑：\n配置事实（证据 #1）给出了极大的内存申请（`1Pi`）。状态事实（证据 #2）显示了 Pod 挂起的结果。调度器发出的 Event 事实（证据 #3）直接排除了其他原因，明确指出是“内存不足”（Insufficient memory）导致 3 个节点均拒绝调度。Topology 事实（证据 #4）验证了配置与 Pod 的归属关系，确保没有配置混淆。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod `aiops-case-v02/app` 配置了 1Pi 的内存请求 (证据 #1) → 该数值远超集群任意单节点（约 31.3 TiB）的物理容量 → 调度器对所有 3 个可用节点判定 Insufficient memory，且无抢占者 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，PodScheduled 为 False (证据 #2, #3)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**资源请求超限导致调度失败**。\n\n容器 `aiops-case-v02/app` 声明了 `1Pi` (1 Pebibyte) 的内存请求，该数量级远超集群中任何单节点（约 31.3 TiB）的总容量，导致 Kubernetes 调度器无法在任何节点上满足该资源约束。调度器在 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` 的事件记录（证据 #3）中直接证实了这一机制。因此，Pod 持续处于 `Pending` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 71.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 71.4s (Evidence 58.7s, RCA 12.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 96.601, "metrics": {"run_id": "b1dba8d300bb4af5", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 96.60806274414062, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 96608.06274414062, "llm_calls": 22, "llm_duration_ms": 91067.6007270813, "tool_calls": 30, "executed_tool_calls": 18, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 11, "successful_tool_calls": 28, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 11714.97654914856, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5093.533992767334}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16615.132093429565, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"